<title>HONG KONG: Nichimen HK sets 1 bln yen leveraged FRN.</title>
<headline>Nichimen HK sets 1 bln yen leveraged FRN.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was announced by lead manager Sakura Finance Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NICHIMEN HONG KONG (CAYMAN) LTD</p>
<p> AMT   1 BLN YEN     COUPON     *	   MATURITY    27.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE  LEVERAGED FRN BASE	YEN LIBOR  PAY DATE    25.SEP.96</p>
<p> RATINGS    NIS A    ISS PRICE  100.25    LAUNCH DATE 20.SEP.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  25B	LISTING    HK	  DENOMS	10 MLN YEN</p>
<p> SALE LIMIT US/UK/HK/JAPAN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH  HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROV    STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES - *COUPON PAYS 3-MONTH LIBOR PLUS 30 BP, 6.0 PCT</p>
<p>		MINUS YEN LIBOR, OR ZERO PERCENT SUBJECT TO THE THEN</p>
<p>		PREVAILING YEN LIBOR RATE ON EACH RELEVANT INTEREST</p>
<p>		DETERMINATION DATE.</p>
<p>		**ISSUE IS THE FIRST SERIES OF NOTES ISSUED OFF</p>
<p>		THE BORROWER'S ASIAN MTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>		***KEEPWELL AGREEMENT FROM NICHIMEN CORP</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
</text>
